{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Tinker: controlled mechanicals assist in Defensive mode (#4110)",
  "contract": [
    "Control Mechanical 807846 is granted at level 24 by AscensionCustomClassData and the class trainer.",
    "Spell.dbc applies the native charm aura to a mechanical, plus 25% attack speed and 2% maximum-health damage",
    "every three seconds. A level-27 Tinker must normally acquire and cast it on Harvest Reaper 115 (a mechanical",
    "using SmartAI). An explicit native Attack command first proves the charm can deal damage, and Passive stops",
    "that explicit attack; the cleared victim is asserted before Stay and a normal Defensive reaction request,",
    "the controlled unit must assist the owner in combat, as PetAI OwnerAttacked and OwnerAttackedBy require for",
    "a defensive charm. The owner starts a normal melee attack, then stops. Only the controlled mechanical can",
    "continue reducing the passive enemy's health after that snapshot, while its short-circuit aura remains",
    "active. Reaction changes use CMSG_PET_ACTION, never direct AI or threat fixtures. The client pet bar is not",
    "rendered. The native Abandon command must release control, remove the short-circuit aura and stop attacking",
    "the former owners enemy."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
